-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 289  creature_template_addon auras -- 16 downported, 4 deliberately stripped
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--     Creature (Entry: 3633347) has wrong spell '82917' defined in `auras`
--     field in `creature_template_addon`.
--
-- 19 lines, 20 distinct spell ids. All 20 resolve in the Cata 4.3.4 Spell.dbc.
--
-- FIRST, WHAT THIS IS NOT. Several of the ids sit in the WotLK numeric range
-- (64573, 65097, 67024, 68268, 68294, 68543, 68603, 69322, 69526), which looks
-- like a Spell.dbc rebuild regression. It is not: none of the 20 exists in the
-- STOCK AzerothCore v19 Spell.dbc either (49,839 records). Blizzard filled gaps
-- in that range during Cataclysm, so they are Cata-era ids that merely look
-- WotLK-era. Checked before writing a single row, because the alternative
-- reading would have meant a destructive rebuild to hunt down.
--
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 🔴 ONLY 16 ARE DOWNPORTED -- THE OTHER 4 WOULD HIDE 102 SPAWNS
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Every candidate was screened for SPELL_AURA_MOD_STEALTH (16),
-- SPELL_AURA_MOD_INVISIBILITY (18) and SPELL_AURA_PHASE (261) -- the check 273_
-- established after nearly importing exactly this class blind. Four are
-- invisibility auras:
--
--   64573  Astranaar's Burning!: Invisibility   type 7
--   65097  Thunder Peak: Invisibility           type 7
--   65499  Quest Invisibility 3                 type 9
--   78718  Generic Quest Invisibility 8         type 16
--
-- They are carried by 6 templates / 102 spawns, ALL in Ashenvale on map 750:
--
--   3634123  Astranaar's Burning! Fire Bunny   45 spawns   64573
--   3634160  Watch Wind Rider                  27          64573
--   3634163  Hellscream's Hellion              27          64573
--   3634283  Sabina Pilgrim                     1          65097
--   3634424  Broken-down Wagon Bunny            1          65499
--   3636210  Sorata Firespinner                 1          78718
--
-- Those 102 spawns are VISIBLE TODAY precisely because the spell is missing and
-- the aura silently fails to apply. Downporting the four would make the aura
-- work and hide all of them -- r23's bug re-created on purpose. In Cataclysm
-- they are revealed by a per-quest-step detection aura DC never ported, and
-- r23's blanket type-7/8 detector is scoped to area 4923 (Hyjal), not 4931
-- (Ashenvale), so it would not save them either.
--
-- So section 2 strips those four ids from `creature_template_addon` instead.
-- That clears their log lines too, and changes nothing a player can see -- the
-- auras are already inert.
--
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 1) The 16 safe rows -- all pure visual FX
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 15 templates / 75 spawns, all map 750:
--   82917 Delgren the Purifier     Respect for the Fallen: Loot FX
--   81550 Feero Ironhand           Respect for the Fallen: Loot FX
--   91378 ELM Bunny                Cosmetic - Shaman Unleash Frost State
--   82781 Laughing Sister x17      Recover the Fallen: Loot FX
--   68603 Arcane Detonation Bunny x3
--   68543 Image of Archmage Xylem  Dressed to Impress force-cast aura
--   67024 Mountainfoot Miner x32   Stonified
--   68268 Lady Vesthra             Cosmetic - Arcane Force Shield (Green)
--   68294 Research Intern x11      Immolation
--   69526 Wind Rider Gorsch        Dizzy
--   69322 Lieutenant Drex          Gob Squad: Rifle Hold
--   79919 Smoot                    Carrying a Samophlange
--   80126 Goblin Siegeworker x2    Goblin Carrying a Horde Crate
--   90317 Bruno Flameretardant     Do it Yourself: Cat's Mark
--   75773 Bruno Flameretardant     Burning Weapon
--   96372 ELM Bunny                Steamy
--
-- Generated by `tools/gen_hyjal_spell_downport_r40.py` using 194_'s calibrated
-- method (the same generator family as r37/r38/r39): SpellCastTimes,
-- SpellDuration, SpellRange and SpellRadius indices are re-mapped by VALUE from
-- the Cata tables onto the live ones rather than copied, so a Cata index that
-- means something different here cannot slip through. Every effect id is < 165
-- and every aura id < 317 -- an effect id >= 165 asserts and segfaults the
-- worldserver at boot ([[spell-effect-range-crash]]); the generator reported no
-- remaps or clamps for this set, so all 16 came across as authored.
--
-- 🔴 THE CLIENT HALF IS NOT OPTIONAL AND IS NOT IN THIS FILE. `spell_dbc` is an
-- OVERLAY holding only custom rows; the worldserver reads the real Spell.dbc
-- from data/dbc. These rows do nothing until Spell.dbc is recompiled and
-- deployed. See the deploy note at the bottom.

DELETE FROM acore_world.`spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (82917,81550,91378,82781,68603,68543,67024,68268,68294,69526,69322,79919,80126,90317,75773,96372);

